0301102317/http://voyager.jpl.nasa.gov/spacecraft/spacecraftlife.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Voyager Spacecraft Lifetime\n    </a>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.hopkins.k12.mn.us/pages/high/courses/online/astro/course_documents/exploration_of_space/nasa/unmanned_space_exploration/unmanned_exploration.htm\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Space Exploration - Robotic Missions\n    </a>\n    <sup class=\"noprint Inline-Template\">\n     <span style=\"white-space: nowrap;\">\n      [\n      <a href=\"/wiki/Wikipedia:%E5%A4%B1%E6%95%88%E9%93%BE%E6%8E%A5\" title=\"Wikipedia:失效链接\">\n       <span title=\"\">\n        失效連結\n       </span>\n      </a>\n      ]\n     </span>\n    </sup>\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://www.jpl.nasa.gov/news/fact_sheets/voyager.pdf\" href=\"https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/news/fact_sheets/voyager.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     NASA Facts - Voyager Mission to the Outer Planets (PDF format)\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210417055931/http://www.jpl.nasa.gov/news/fact_sheets/voyager.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://ntrs.nasa.gov/archive/nasa/casi.ntrs.nasa.gov/19840027171_1984027171.pdf\" href=\"https://ntrs.nasa.gov/archive/nasa/casi.ntrs.nasa.gov/19840027171_1984027171.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Voyager 1 and 2 atlas of six Saturnian satellites (PDF format) 1984\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210417055940/http://ntrs.nasa.gov/archive/nasa/casi.ntrs.nasa.gov/19840027171_1984027171.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://voyager.jpl.nasa.gov/mission/weekly-reports/\" href=\"https://voyager.jpl.nasa.gov/mission/weekly-reports/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Mission state (more often than not at least 3 months out of date)\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20060705191724/http://voyager.jpl.nasa.gov/mission/weekly-reports/\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" data-mw-original-href=\"http://descanso.jpl.nasa.gov/DPSummary/Descanso4--Voyager_new.pdf\" href=\"https://descanso.jpl.nasa.gov/DPSummary/Descanso4--Voyager_new.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     JPL Voyager Telecom Manual\n    </a>\n    （\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"//web.archive.org/web/20210318092548/http://descanso.jpl.nasa.gov/DPSummary/Descanso4--Voyager_new.pdf\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     页面存档备份\n    </a>\n    ，存于\n    <a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BA%92%E8%81%94%E7%BD%91%E6%A1%A3%E6%A1%88%E9%A6%86\" title=\"互联网档案馆\">\n     互联网档案馆\n    </a>\n    ）\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070427184732/http://www.heavens-above.com/solar-escape.asp\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     Spacecraft Escaping the Solar System\n    </a>\n    - current positions and diagrams\n   </li>\n   <li>\n    <a class=\"external text\" href=\"https://web.archive.org/web/20070930185312/http://www.sciencefriday.com/pages/2007/Aug/hour1_082407.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n     NPR: Science Friday 8/24/07 Interviews for 30th anniversary of Voyager spacecrafts\n    </a>\n   </li>\n  </ul>\n  <!-- \nNewPP limit report\nParsed by mw‐web.codfw.main‐b76fc9c4b‐kgx2g\nCached time: 20260614235131\nCache expiry: 1382911\nCache expiry source: Template:Dead_link (#time)\nReduced expiry: true\nComplications: [pr